== D1 partial withdraw / debate limit
  max_debate_rounds=3; one co-maker withdrew in debate round 2; question put after debate round 5
  RESULT: CONFIRMED DEFECT — partial withdrawal reset the debate-round limit (put at 5, expected 3)
== D2 all-gone adjourn in ticks
  ticks: ['r1', 'r2', None, None, None]; adjourned=True after 0.00s; reason: ['no quorum in 2 consecutive rounds']
  RESULT: observation (design): inquorate rounds are ticks, not time; a convene with nobody arriving adjourns on the second tick after arrival_grace_s
