== D5 replace promise
  council_submit description says: "Submit your sealed intent for the open round. Nobody sees it until the round closes, when everyone's are revealed together. You may replace it until the round c"
  seat_token advertised on single-seat server: False
  status view after submitting: You have submitted (sealed): {'action': 'present'}. You may replace it until the round closes.
  second submit -> REFUSED: REFUSED: you already submitted in r1; submissions are final (charter round_policy.replaceable=false)
  RESULT: CONFIRMED: members are told twice they may replace; the server refuses
== E replay is not tamper evidence
  tampered trial-4 (all r8 votes -> no, sealed/ deleted): steward replay says: events: 34; chain: OK; replay: OK (every derived event recomputed identically)
  vote-result now: rejected {'abstain': 0, 'no': 4, 'yes': 0}
  RESULT: CONFIRMED: replay+chain are derivation checks, not tamper evidence; sealed/ is not cross-checked
